==================================================================================================
  the three pre-registered curves, 2-bin slope over [R500, 2R500]:
    F_phantom-only (G113):       -1.49  (the phantom isotherm x gas envelope, y ~ b^-(q-1))
    F_classic beta = 2/3:         -3.00  (y ~ b^-3)
    F_JOINT (G113 x G122):        -2.54  (the closed coherency: phantom + r^-1 dust envelope, y ~ b^-(q-0.01))
  separations (slope units; G129's forecast slope error 0.32 per cluster, 0.09 pooled over 12):
    |F_JOINT - F_phantom| = 1.05  -> 11.6 sigma pooled (3.3 per cluster)
    |F_JOINT - F_classic| = 0.46  -> 5.2 sigma pooled (1.5 per cluster)
    |F_phantom - F_classic| = 1.51  -> 16.8 sigma pooled (4.7 per cluster)

